        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Pou rui khangloumei 1@: ninga,",
            "Kap lak nituang ham me;",
            "Kabiang kaphiloumei le bailoumei guai 1@:,",
            "Ningtou puinung kap pui lu 1@: suanni.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Adi su cho khang loumei 1@:? (2)",
            "Kandih guloumeipu jai kanthe tarou thang;",
            "Poubaumei njangmei su rianra ni.",
            "",
            "2. Judah nun rui tithei khang 1@:,",
            "Ningtou bam pusini;",
            "Aithu ning bam makge poubaumei njangmei,",
            "Akhang rui nkhuaimei sulou kanthe.",
            "",
            "3. Pou rui theimei 1@: hou lana,",
            "Mei guai neila bam me;",
            "Neila makmei nun rui kapma kapum puanpat,",
            "Tarou lung khou 1@: tijip lou kan the.",
            "",
            "4. Thao dat kan the kanloumeipu,",
            "Banthai ram njuan khang;",
            "Olive ching rukhou 1@: muang rukhou dunglana,",
            "Gaipui ram njuan the kanloumei pu."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
